# Roo Code / Cline Architecture & Engineering Rules for Cognitive CRM

## Project Overview
This project is **Cognitive CRM (Enterprise Intelligence Platform)** built with Vite, React 19, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, based on Stitch Project ID `8736786426951694813` ("Luminous Executive Intelligence").

## Architecture & Code Conventions
- **Component Hierarchy**:
  - `src/views/`: Primary views (`PipelineDashboardView`, `LeadFeedScoringView`, `MeetingDebriefView`, `ContactDossierCopilotView`, `AnalyticsView`, `SettingsView`).
  - `src/components/`: Shared app components (`Sidebar`, `TopNav`, `CommandPaletteModal`, `CopilotDrawer`, `NewLeadModal`, `ToastContainer`).
  - `src/context/`: `CrmContext.tsx` contains global state (deals, CRM field updates, action items, telemetry signals, copilot messages).
  - `src/types.ts`: TypeScript contracts and domain models.
- **Styling**:
  - Tailwind CSS with exact design tokens defined in `tailwind.config.js`.
  - Dark mode (`class="dark"` on `<html>`).
  - Color palette: Canvas background `#0f131c`, Primary violet `#7c3aed`, Cyber cyan `#4cd7f6`, Emerald metric `#4edea3`, Surface container `#1c1f29`.
  - Glassmorphic panels: `.glass-panel`, `.glass-panel-elevated`, `.ai-glow`, `.emerald-glow`, `.neon-purple-glow`.
  - Fonts: Headlines use Plus Jakarta Sans (`font-headline`), Body & Data metrics use Inter (`font-body`), Monospace for financial figures and timestamps (`font-mono`).
- **Icons**:
  - Google Material Symbols Outlined (`<span className="material-symbols-outlined">icon_name</span>`).

## Verification Commands
Before completing any task:
1. `npm run build` must pass with zero TypeScript errors and zero bundle warnings.
2. Ensure state updates propagate reactively across all connected views.

